WEBVTT

00:00:00.705 --> 00:00:03.877
Tutorial six. Run, preview and save.

00:00:04.942 --> 00:00:09.508
Tick Preview only, if you want to look at the results before anything is saved.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:19.179
Press Run. The log lists every step as it happens: filters, conversions, tests and figures.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:23.674
A full run takes a minute or two. It is shown here speeded up.

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:33.475
Done. The workbook and the figures are ready.

00:00:33.746 --> 00:00:39.380
Previews of the figures appear in the app. Each panel is also written as its own file.

00:00:40.196 --> 00:00:44.111
Here is the combined figure, with every panel and every group.

00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:47.856
And the double-angle astigmatism plots.

00:00:48.731 --> 00:00:52.228
You can open any sheet of the workbook without leaving the app.

00:00:54.815 --> 00:01:03.188
This is the outcome table, exactly as it is written to Excel: a column for each group, the P value, and the test that was used.

00:01:03.471 --> 00:01:09.523
When you are happy with the results, save everything to your output folder, or only the files you want.

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:14.834
StandardEyes. For ophthalmologists, by ophthalmologists.

